**Read:** [Outgassing properties of vacuum materials — Paolo Chiggiato](../sources/Outgassing-Properties-Chiggiato.lingua#r_18MM2A316NWRJABS8E53468PWT), adsorption/desorption and measurement passages; [Certification of gas-mixture reference materials — NIST SP 260-222](../sources/Gas-Mixture-Reference-Materials-NIST.lingua#r_471GDGAT44EMNYFBERQSMVE2C8), stability and assigned composition.

The delivery surface can store water or another trace species and release it later. Earlier surface residence and diffusion models therefore apply to a positive-pressure analytical line as well as a vacuum chamber. A gas with low source impurity can acquire contamination during transport; a changed concentration can be delayed or distorted by surface exchange.

Represent the gas and surface inventories separately. If ng is the impurity in the gas and ns on the surface, adsorption contributes −ra to ṅg and +ra to ṅs; desorption contributes the opposite signs. Their sum must leave only external inflow, outflow, reaction or leakage. A fitted exponential with no stated storage mechanism can hide a balance error.

Exposure history, humidity, temperature, surface preparation and elapsed time matter. A small sample line may have a much larger surface-to-gas-volume ratio than the production pipe it is intended to represent. Purging clears mobile gas before it necessarily clears the surface inventory.

**Work:** Predict the response to a step up and a step down in impurity. Explain why different recovery times can reveal nonlinear adsorption or multiple states. Keep blank history and response time with any claimed detection or acceptance result.

**Return:** [Industrial gases, vacuum and high-purity supplies — from molecules to useful service](../Industrial-gases-and-vacuum.lingua#r_3GHQJEYMYEN6JDKSF4PPJ403RF).
